Looking at the implementation and ticket requirements, I'll write a comprehensive pytest suite covering:
- Normal formatting with various decimal places
- ROUND_HALF_EVEN rounding behavior
- Currency lookup precedence (KeyError before ValueError)
- Input parsing edge cases (scientific notation, whitespace, signs)
- Error conditions (invalid amounts, non-finite values)
- Zero and negative zero handling
- Output format constraints (no exponent notation, exact decimal places)

